{"ext":"u1-5","dialogue":{"type":"dialogue","instruction":"Chatea con el aldeano sobre lo que hacen en el pueblo. Elige la respuesta correcta en cada turno.","persona":"Aldeano Alex","turns":[{"npc":"Hi! What do you do here?","options":[{"text":"I mine stone","correct":true},{"text":"I mines stone","correct":false},{"text":"I stone mine","correct":false}]},{"npc":"Nice! Can you build a house?","options":[{"text":"Yes, I build a house","correct":true},{"text":"Yes, I builds a house","correct":false},{"text":"Yes, I house build","correct":false}]},{"npc":"Cool! Now look at the zombie. What do we do?","options":[{"text":"We run away!","correct":true},{"text":"We runs away!","correct":false},{"text":"We away run!","correct":false}]},{"npc":"Good job! Do you want to eat now?","options":[{"text":"Yes, I eat bread","correct":true},{"text":"Yes, I eats bread","correct":false},{"text":"Yes, I bread eat","correct":false}]}]}}